/*
 * ATLAS V1 ground-station application ported to the ATLAS V2 board.
 * Replace Core/Src/main.c in the WORKING V2 CubeIDE project, not the V1 project.
 * Keep the V2 startup/linker files, HAL MSP, FatFs USER driver and user_diskio.c.
 * The supplied main.c does not include those project dependencies.
 *
 * ESP32 wiring: V2 PA9 TX -> ESP32 RX, V2 PA10 RX <- ESP32 TX,
 * common GND, 3.3 V UART levels, 115200 baud 8N1 (original V1 speed).
 * LoRa: SPI1, PB8 CS. SD: SPI2, PA8 CS, USERFatFS/USERPath.
 * Battery: PB1/ADC1_IN9, 101k/47k divider. LED: PB9.
 * Both original LED roles share PB9 because the V2 reference has one LED.
 * Radio initialization follows V2's no-reset-pin approach.
 * ARM PB0, APO PA0, MAIN PA3, AUX PB2 and buzzer PA15 remain LOW.
 * Application packets, commands, ACK logic and CSV layout remain from V1.
 * This is ground-station firmware, not the onboard flight application.
 * Source reviewed only: a target build and hardware test are still required.
 */
